      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just a comment: We don't have RenderTexture, Texture, Texture2D, Texture2DArray, Texture3D, CustomRenderTexture, Cubemap or CubemapArray types exposed, so the way you would have to use it for now is by storing texture references in material properties and noodle it from a Material.GetTexture node.\n\nAdding all Texture types should be left as its own canny: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/add-rendertexture-texture-sprite-texture2d-texture2darray-texture3d-customrender",
      "viewerReactions": null
